  "note": "M12 audio (ADR 0019). Files are relative to res://assets/audio/. Buses: Music, Ambience, SFX, UI. A cue's variants play round-robin. footsteps: tile id -> cue; the key winter is the step on snow-covered ground (a tile with a winter_color, outdoors in winter). actions: action id -> cue, plus the use-menu ids (sleep, take, buy, sell, use, ride, portal) and door (walking between indoors and outdoors). pages: System page kind -> cue; open is the sound of a kind that is not listed, and an empty cue is silent; death is the Local News page when tonight's news tells of a death (M12.5). enemies: enemy type -> {hurt, gone}; Gnolls, Goblins and Antinium are people in the books, so no animal noises for Gnolls. moods: map id (else the map's location) -> mood; mood_tracks: mood -> {day, night, winter_day, winter_night} track (a missing variant falls back to night, then day); states: title, fight, battle (a staged fight), scene (a scene stage). moments (M12.5): canon moments, first match wins over every state: when_flags, unless_flags, areas, and stages (event ids: a live scene stage or the staged fight in progress). ambience (M12.4): the area bed, a looping sound cue on the Ambience bus; by_map: map id -> place, else indoor / outdoor; beds: place -> {day, night, winter_day, winter_night} cue (the music fallback; an empty cue is silent). Object loops: an object kind's \"sound\" in objects.json names a cue here. Presentation only.",
